<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 136,083.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 136,083.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 3 totaled 136,083 bales, down from 157,237 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 260 bales awaiting review, 21,154 cancellations, and 502 decertification orders.</p>
<p>CSCE was closed Friday in observance of U.S. Independence Day.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
